---
import TitleLv2 from "../common/TitleLv2.astro";
---

<section class="works-reaction">
  <div class="l-container">
    <div class="l-section">
      <TitleLv2 title="公開後の反応・状況"/>
      <div class="l-section-body">
        <ul class="works-reaction-list c-list-green-line">
          <li class="works-reaction-item c-list-green-line-item">地域検索からの流入が生まれ、見込み客との接点づくりに寄与</li>
          <li class="works-reaction-item c-list-green-line-item">「羽生市 腸律」で1位表示</li>
          <li class="works-reaction-item c-list-green-line-item">「羽生市 よもぎ蒸し」「羽生市 アロマ」でも上位表示</li>
          <li class="works-reaction-item c-list-green-line-item">小規模サロンでも継続運用しやすい情報発信土台として機能</li>
        </ul>
      </div><!-- /.l-section-body -->
    </div><!-- /.l-section -->
  </div><!-- /.l-container -->
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use '../../styles/breakpoints' as *;

</style>
